title: "Homogeneous cubic vectorial bent functions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An explicit family from 8r input bits to r output bits for every r at least two, with every nonzero output component a homogeneous cubic bent function. This answers Open Problem 4.31 in Polujan’s 2021 dissertation. The explicit parity-fiber lift and verification are self-contained."
